OL,3,GNEWSASchool holiday travel prices lead
OL,4,Ato pupil absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said the high cost of
OL,7,Ftravelling abroad during the school
OL,8,Fholidays has lead them to take their
OL,9,Fchildren out of school for a trip.
OL,11,FMum-of-two Annie Noble said the price
OL,12,Fof flights and hotels for her family to
OL,13,Fvisit Belfast had more than doubled
OL,14,Fduring the school holidays, compared to
OL,15,Fterm time.
OL,17,FA record number of fines were issued in
OL,18,FEngland last year for children being
OL,19,Ftaken out of school for holidays and
OL,20,Fsome parents have said they accept the
OL,21,Ffines because they can save so much
OL,22,Fmoney.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
