OL,3,GNEWSASchool holiday travel prices lead
OL,4,Ato pupil absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education departments in Jersey and
OL,7,FGuernsey do not issue fines but they
OL,8,Fhave told parents they should "avoid
OL,9,Fbooking holidays in term time whenever
OL,10,Fpossible".
